# Root .gitignore for the COMP6900 "Rindr" fruit identification project.
# Applies across all subprojects (frontend/, backend/, model/, etc.) added
# by any team member.

# Dependencies & build artifacts (any subfolder)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Python (model training / backend, if Python-based)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/*.egg-info/

# Vercel
**/.vercel

# Env files / secrets - never commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Large datasets: keep raw images out of git by default (see
# model/dataset README for how/where to store or link the actual dataset -
# e.g. Git LFS, cloud storage, or a shared drive link - since thousands of
# training photos should not be committed as plain files to GitHub).
**/dataset/raw/
**/dataset/**/*.jpg
**/dataset/**/*.jpeg
**/dataset/**/*.png

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
